  "statement": "Under CTX_COMPLEX, all H_i(F) are killed by a power of I and have finite length, and lambda H_i(F)=0 for i>0. If sum_i (-1)^i b_i=0 and all differential entries lie in I^s, s>=1, then lambda H_0(F)>=mu s^h (b_0-(A_h/s)sum_i b_i), with A_1=0 and A_h=max{h,3(h-1)h^(h-1)/(2(h-1)!)} for h>=2. No Noetherianity or completeness of C is assumed."
}
